================================================================
110. DEFINITION OF DONE
================================================================

Upgrade-07 is complete only if:

[ ] Upgrade-06 runtime adapters have adversarial contract tests
[ ] fake/stub-only adapters are not misreported as implemented
[ ] job claiming is atomic
[ ] worker leases exist
[ ] crash recovery works
[ ] scheduler is bounded
[ ] per-repository concurrency is safe
[ ] Git worktrees remain isolated
[ ] GitHub integration has one clean adapter boundary
[ ] GitHub credentials never enter event/job storage
[ ] PR creation is idempotent
[ ] CI state is normalized
[ ] CI repair loops are bounded
[ ] repeated failure detection works
[ ] human reviews are preserved
[ ] protected branches are respected
[ ] merge queue semantics are handled correctly
[ ] merge_group workflow requirement is audited
[ ] webhook signatures are verified
[ ] webhook deliveries are deduplicated
[ ] external mutations survive process crash safely
[ ] fork PR security is enforced
[ ] sensitive workflow changes receive stronger policy
[ ] full offline end-to-end PR workflow passes
[ ] crashed PR creation reconciliation passes
[ ] crashed merge reconciliation passes
[ ] default CI needs no Anthropic/GitHub live credentials
[ ] release gate covers all new subsystems
[ ] documentation matches implementation
[ ] no P0/P1 security/correctness issue remains

